{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-11b4b5d7abe0","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-11b4b5d7abe0","name":"洋葱炒鸡蛋","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1%E7%82%92%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B/%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1%E7%82%92%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B.md","blob_sha":"4c62abfc66f4f2188f82ada2cd045a1a88d1fedd","details":{"introduction":"洋葱炒鸡蛋是一道咸香适口、葱香浓郁的家常菜肴，鸡蛋嫩滑，洋葱清甜，属于国民下饭菜。鸡蛋富含优质蛋白质和多种维生素，洋葱含有膳食纤维和抗氧化物质，是一道营养均衡的快手菜。这道菜操作极其简单，对新手非常友好，从备料到出锅只需约 5 分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"* 鸡蛋\n* 洋葱\n* 食用油\n* 盐\n* 葱\n* 料酒"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n* 鸡蛋 2 个\n* 洋葱 50 g\n* 食用油 50 ml\n* 盐 2 g\n* 葱 半 根\n* 料酒 2 ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 鸡蛋打入大碗中，加入洋葱片、盐后搅拌 60 S\n2. 起锅烧油，倒入鸡蛋，一面煎炸 30-45 S ，翻面继续翻炒，反复 2-3 分钟 后散上料酒出锅\n3. 鸡蛋装盘，散上葱花"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：洋葱200g、净全鸡蛋液150g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g、小葱8g；整份约350g。不加料酒的家庭标准变体，洋葱去皮净重。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":122.76,"protein_g":6.0704,"carbohydrate_g":5.813486,"fat_g":8.422914},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients","version":"1e0110dae7a1cfc6","fdc_ids":[170000,171287,171411,173468,170005]},"profile_id":"family-11b4b5d7abe0-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-11b4b5d7abe0","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-11b4b5d7abe0","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-11b4b5d7abe0-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"onion","grams":200},{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"oil","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"scallion","grams":8}],"e